title: "Modelling and Optimization of Traffic Route Graph Based on Flex-Grid and Space-Division Multiplexing (SDM) in Modern Optical Communication Systems (Transparent Optical Networks)"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Sabilly"
    given-names: "Ikhlas"
