version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-26"
license-url: "LICENSE"
keywords:
  - elastic optical networks
  - flex-grid
  - space-division multiplexing
  - multi-core fibre
  - transparent optical networks
  - RMSA
  - GN model
  - OXC dimensioning
  - graph centrality
  - metaheuristic optimization
abstract: >-
  A discrete-event study of routing, modulation and spectrum assignment on the 19-node IDNet optical
  backbone with flex-grid, C+L multi-band and multi-core (SDM) fibre, GN-model quality of transmission,
  finite transceiver and OXC resources, graph-based node dimensioning and simulation-in-the-loop
  metaheuristic optimisation.
